So Michael and Dwight have this whole ruse to get Jim to go to Utica with them.
所以迈克尔和德怀特设了个局，想让吉姆跟他们一起去尤蒂卡。

606
00:27:34.520 --> 00:27:40.300
They tell them that this company has lost the Staples account and they're going to go and they're going to get it.
他们告诉吉姆，公司丢了史泰博的客户，他们要去把客户争取回来。

607
00:27:40.300 --> 00:27:42.040
And Jim has to come with them.
而且吉姆必须跟他们一起去。

608
00:27:42.500 --> 00:27:43.860
So off they go.
于是他们出发了。

609
00:27:44.760 --> 00:27:45.040
Yeah.
是啊。

610
00:27:45.540 --> 00:27:45.820
Yeah.
没错。

611
00:27:46.180 --> 00:27:47.540
So they're in the car.
他们在车里。

612
00:27:48.420 --> 00:27:49.500
Jim notices.
吉姆注意到了。

613
00:27:49.960 --> 00:27:50.840
Oh, no, wait.
噢，不对，等等。

614
00:27:50.940 --> 00:27:51.740
You missed the exit.
你错过出口了。

615
00:27:51.980 --> 00:27:57.560
And that's when Dwight and Michael are like, we have a surprise for you.
就在那时，德怀特和迈克尔说，我们有个惊喜要给你。

616
00:27:58.260 --> 00:28:01.960
Jim is immediately, immediately terrified.
吉姆立刻，立刻就吓坏了。

617
00:28:01.960 --> 00:28:05.380
The look on Rain's face in the backseat is Dwight.
雷恩坐在后座上的表情就是德怀特。

618
00:28:05.540 --> 00:28:10.600
He could barely contain like how giddy he was that they roped Jim into this.
他几乎无法抑制自己把吉姆骗上贼船的那种兴奋劲儿。

619
00:28:10.740 --> 00:28:13.840
And Michael's like, we're going on a panty raid to Utica.
迈克尔说，我们要去尤蒂卡搞“内裤突袭”了。

620
00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:15.100
My God.
天哪。

621
00:28:15.300 --> 00:28:15.960
Oh, my gosh.
我的天。

622
00:28:16.120 --> 00:28:17.800
And Jim's like, no, no.
吉姆说，不，不。

623
00:28:18.020 --> 00:28:19.300
He gets out his cell phone.
他拿出手机。

624
00:28:19.460 --> 00:28:20.660
He's going to make a phone call.
他想打个电话。

625
00:28:20.840 --> 00:28:24.380
But Dwight grabs it and throws his phone out the window.
但德怀特一把抢过手机，把它扔出了窗外。

626
00:28:25.120 --> 00:28:25.440
Yeah.
没错。

627
00:28:26.060 --> 00:28:27.280
Throws his phone out the window.
把他的手机扔出了窗外。

628
00:28:27.520 --> 00:28:29.840
And also, Michael says, had to be done.
而且迈克尔还说，不得不这么做。

629
00:28:30.020 --> 00:28:30.760
Had to be done.
不得不这么做。

630
00:28:30.760 --> 00:28:31.660
I'm like, what?
我心想，什么？

631
00:28:32.880 --> 00:28:36.860
We had a fan question from Icy Lee and Emily Jones.
我们收到了来自艾西·李和艾米丽·琼斯的粉丝提问。

632
00:28:37.040 --> 00:28:41.600
When they threw Jim's phone out the window, did someone have to go pick it up behind the car?
当他们把吉姆的手机扔出窗外时，是不是有人得去车后把它捡回来？

633
00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:42.760
Was that a real phone?
那是真手机吗？

634
00:28:43.260 --> 00:28:43.680
Okay.
好的。

635
00:28:43.700 --> 00:28:44.720
It was a real phone.
那是真手机。

636
00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:50.340
And yes, we had a follow car, which is a car that follows the actors.
是的，我们有一辆跟随车，就是跟在演员车后面的那辆车。

637
00:28:50.660 --> 00:28:53.720
And they would have to stop and pick up that phone.
他们得停下来去把手机捡回来。

638
00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:54.500
Yeah.
是啊。

639
00:28:54.760 --> 00:28:59.260
We had a fan catch from Doug Schmidt, who says, not a question.
我们收到了道格·施密特的一个粉丝发现，他说，这不是个问题。

640
00:28:59.260 --> 00:29:03.980
But when Dwight throws Jim's phone out the window, they are clearly on a four-lane road.
但当德怀特把吉姆的手机扔出窗外时，他们显然是在一条四车道的路上。

641
00:29:03.980 --> 00:29:07.200
But when they stop to find it, it's only a two-lane road.
可当他们停下来找手机时，那却变成了一条两车道的路。

642
00:29:07.620 --> 00:29:09.440
Look at you with your catch, Doug.
真有你的，道格，观察得真仔细。

643
00:29:09.660 --> 00:29:10.100
You go.
你真行。

644
00:29:10.440 --> 00:29:12.920
And another catch from Emily Ambris.
还有来自艾米丽·安布里斯的另一个发现。

645
00:29:13.060 --> 00:29:19.660
At 8 minutes, 45 seconds, when they've stopped to retrieve the phone, you can see a road sign that says,
在8分45秒时，当他们停下来捡手机时，你可以看到一个路牌写着，

646
00:29:19.660 --> 00:29:21.900
San Fernando, in a fourth of a mile.
圣费尔南多，四分之一英里。

647
00:29:22.620 --> 00:29:24.780
Oh, that's a really good catch.
噢，这发现太棒了。

648
00:29:24.980 --> 00:29:27.140
So, yeah, clearly in California.
所以，没错，显然是在加州拍的。

649
00:29:27.940 --> 00:29:29.800
So, they're looking for Jim's phone.
所以，他们在找吉姆的手机。

650
00:29:30.140 --> 00:29:31.200
Jim finds it.
吉姆找到了。

651
00:29:31.300 --> 00:29:31.940
And he's like, you know what?
然后他说，你知道吗？

652
00:29:31.960 --> 00:29:32.760
I'm going to call a cab.
我要去叫辆出租车。

653
00:29:33.160 --> 00:29:35.960
And they're like, okay, well, you'll miss out on the pranks.
他们就说，好吧，那你就会错过恶作剧了。

654
00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:36.660
And he's like, hold up.
然后他说，等等。

655
00:29:36.740 --> 00:29:37.460
What are you guys doing?
你们在搞什么？

656
00:29:37.600 --> 00:29:38.260
What do you have planned?
你们打算做什么？

657
00:29:38.420 --> 00:29:39.780
And then Michael lists off.
接着迈克尔列举了一通。

658
00:29:39.940 --> 00:29:42.940
They have the warehouse uniforms, silly string.
他们有仓库员工制服，还有彩带喷雾。

659
00:29:43.520 --> 00:29:48.420
Dwight also has some gasoline and chunks of rubber to make stink bombs or real bombs.
德怀特还带了些汽油和橡胶块，打算做臭气弹或者真炸弹。

660
00:29:48.420 --> 00:29:49.140
They don't know.
他们不知道。

661
00:29:49.440 --> 00:29:49.540
Yeah.
是啊。

662
00:29:49.720 --> 00:29:50.320
Could be badass.
可能会很带劲。

663
00:29:50.640 --> 00:29:51.120
They don't know.
他们不知道。

664
00:29:51.260 --> 00:29:52.220
It could be either one.
可能是其中任何一种。

665
00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:54.160
And Jim's like, yeah, no, that's not happening.
吉姆就说，不行，这绝对不行。

666
00:29:54.380 --> 00:29:57.360
So, he makes a deal with them that he'll dress up in the warehouse uniform.
于是，他跟他们达成协议，他会穿上仓库员工的制服。

667
00:29:57.360 --> 00:29:59.440
By the way, the one he got was Madges.
顺便说一下，他拿的那件是玛奇的。

668
00:29:59.980 --> 00:30:00.380
Yes.
没错。

669
00:30:00.580 --> 00:30:03.960
And that he will go with them, but no stink bombs or shenanigans.
并且他会跟他们一起去，但不准带臭气弹或搞恶作剧。

670
00:30:04.520 --> 00:30:07.600
Yeah, this is the compromise that he makes.
没错，这就是他做出的妥协。

671
00:30:07.920 --> 00:30:13.800
And from this talking head, it cuts to this silent moment in the car, 9 minutes, 45 seconds,
从这段采访镜头切到了车里的一段沉默时刻，9分45秒时，

672
00:30:13.800 --> 00:30:18.300
the three of them in the uniforms with these ridiculous mustaches.
他们三个人穿着制服，留着滑稽的胡子。

673
00:30:18.300 --> 00:30:20.380
It is such a funny cut, too.
这个剪辑也太搞笑了。

674
00:30:20.620 --> 00:30:22.320
It cracked me up.
把我逗乐了。

675
00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:29.120
I have so much to say about these car scenes, but I think we should take a break and come
关于这些车内场景我有太多话想说，但我觉得我们应该休息一下，回来

676
00:30:29.120 --> 00:30:30.500
back and really get into it.
再深入探讨。

677
00:30:30.700 --> 00:30:33.140
Have you ever peed in a bottle in the backseat of a car?
你有没有在汽车后座往瓶子里尿过尿？

678
00:30:33.480 --> 00:30:34.200
I have not.
我没有。

679
00:30:34.340 --> 00:30:34.640
Have you?
你有吗？

680
00:30:34.900 --> 00:30:36.460
I thought about it real serious.
我认真考虑过。

681
00:30:37.120 --> 00:30:39.100
I've peed on the side of a lot of roads.
我在路边尿过很多次。

682
00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:39.920
Same.
我也是。

683
00:30:40.360 --> 00:30:43.900
Okay, well, more to discuss when we come back.
好吧，回来后还有更多要讨论的。

684
00:30:54.040 --> 00:30:57.500
We are back and the boys are in the car.
我们回来了，男人们在车里。

685
00:30:57.660 --> 00:30:58.900
They've got their outfits on.
他们穿上了行头。

686
00:30:59.020 --> 00:31:00.680
They've got their mustaches on.
他们贴上了胡子。

687
00:31:00.860 --> 00:31:02.260
They're driving to Utica.
他们正开车去尤蒂卡。

688
00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:06.480
Michael is asking Jim a lot of questions about his breakup with Karen.
迈克尔问了吉姆很多关于他和凯伦分手的问题。

689
00:31:06.800 --> 00:31:08.580
And Jim doesn't want to talk about it.
吉姆不想谈这个。

690
00:31:08.700 --> 00:31:11.500
So, Jim is like, let's play that alphabet game that you want to play.
所以，吉姆说，我们来玩那个你想玩的字母游戏吧。

691
00:31:11.780 --> 00:31:12.260
Yes.
没错。

692
00:31:12.680 --> 00:31:17.740
And Michael's like, okay, A is for Alan and he's married to Alice and they live in
迈克尔说，好，A是艾伦，他娶了爱丽丝，他们住在

693
00:31:17.740 --> 00:31:20.600
Alaska and they sell, what do they sell?
阿拉斯加，他们卖，他们卖什么来着？

694
00:31:20.940 --> 00:31:21.760
What do they sell?
他们卖什么？

695
00:31:22.200 --> 00:31:24.800
And then he's like, wait, what is that noise?
然后他说，等等，那是什么声音？

696
00:31:24.940 --> 00:31:26.680
I hear, is that water like in the engine?
我听见，是引擎里有水吗？

697
00:31:26.900 --> 00:31:28.580
Like what, is that air conditioner leaking?
比如，是空调在漏水吗？

698
00:31:28.820 --> 00:31:29.880
What's that sound?
那是什么声音？

699
00:31:30.460 --> 00:31:34.700
Oh, that sound is Dwight peeing in a can in the backseat.
哦，那个声音是德怀特在后座往罐子里尿尿。

700
00:31:35.260 --> 00:31:37.280
And they freak out.
然后他们吓坏了。

701
00:31:37.440 --> 00:31:38.520
They're like, oh, gross.
他们就像是，噢，真恶心。

702
00:31:38.520 --> 00:31:42.420
And then Michael starts swerving and Dwight's like, you're making me spray.
然后迈克尔开始乱打方向盘，德怀特就说，你弄得我喷出来了。

703
00:31:43.560 --> 00:31:46.640
This scene is like so fun to watch.
这一幕看起来真的太有趣了。

704
00:31:46.780 --> 00:31:48.420
I was laughing so hard.
我当时笑得不行。

705
00:31:48.760 --> 00:31:50.820
We got a lot of mail about this scene.
我们收到了很多关于这一幕的来信。

706
00:31:51.160 --> 00:31:57.720
One from Sadie K who says, when the guys were in the car, did they break a lot?
其中一封来自Sadie K，她问，当他们几个在车里的时候，他们有没有频繁笑场？

707
00:31:57.720 --> 00:32:02.640
Oh, Sadie, the bloopers from this scene are so worth it.
噢，Sadie，这一幕的NG花絮绝对值得一看。

708
00:32:02.840 --> 00:32:04.020
You've got to watch it.
你一定要去看看。

709
00:32:04.220 --> 00:32:05.460
They were cracking up.
他们当时都快笑疯了。

710
00:32:05.640 --> 00:32:09.480
I mean, it's one of the like rare times where Steve could not keep it together.
我是说，这是史蒂夫极少数无法控制住自己不笑的时刻之一。

711
00:32:09.840 --> 00:32:10.300
Steve.
史蒂夫。

712
00:32:10.600 --> 00:32:10.740
Yeah.
没错。

713
00:32:10.740 --> 00:32:16.000
Every time, too, Rain would have to say, I think I cut my penis on the lid.
而且每一次，雷恩都得说，我觉得我的阴茎被盖子割到了。

714
00:32:16.280 --> 00:32:21.180
And then this is in the deleted scenes, but it's also in the bloopers.
这一段在删减片段里有，但NG花絮里也有。

715
00:32:21.600 --> 00:32:25.960
At the very end, Dwight goes, I cut a chunk out of my penis for nothing.
在最后，德怀特说，我白白割掉了一块阴茎肉。

716
00:32:26.600 --> 00:32:29.140
Those guys could not get through it.
那几个人根本演不下去。

717
00:32:29.360 --> 00:32:32.440
They were like melting into laughter.
他们简直笑得瘫成了一团。

718
00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:35.900
I mean, just imagine being in a car together.
我是说，想象一下他们三个待在车里。

719
00:32:36.160 --> 00:32:39.220
These three comedic actors at the top of their game.
这三位喜剧演员正处于他们事业的巅峰。

720
00:32:39.220 --> 00:32:40.580
I mean, brilliant.
我是说，太天才了。

721
00:32:40.980 --> 00:32:44.260
We had another fan question from Evan Derrickson.
我们还有另一个来自Evan Derrickson的粉丝提问。

722
00:32:44.480 --> 00:32:46.000
This is a technical question.
这是一个技术性问题。

723
00:32:46.300 --> 00:32:51.420
Evan wants to know who got to decide who wears which mustache because they're really perfect
Evan想知道是谁决定了谁戴哪种胡子，因为它们真的非常适合每个角色，而且太搞笑了。

724
00:32:51.420 --> 00:32:53.360
for each character and so funny.
这是服装组的事吗？

725
00:32:53.540 --> 00:32:54.860
Is that a wardrobe thing?
是服装部门负责的吗？

726
00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:56.500
Does it need Greg's approval?
需要格雷格的批准吗？

727
00:32:56.780 --> 00:32:57.600
Is it props?
是道具组吗？

728
00:32:58.760 --> 00:33:03.000
Well, Evan, I like your question because you've clearly been listening to Office Ladies.
嗯，Evan，我喜欢你的问题，因为你显然一直在听《办公室女士》播客。

729
00:33:03.340 --> 00:33:06.740
The mustaches are made by hair and makeup.
胡子是由发型和化妆部门制作的。

730
00:33:06.740 --> 00:33:08.120
So it's not a prop.
所以它不是道具。

731
00:33:08.120 --> 00:33:14.220
And hair and makeup work together because it's hair because it's a mustache, right?
发型和化妆部门会一起合作，因为它是头发，毕竟是胡子，对吧？

732
00:33:14.320 --> 00:33:17.440
But then it goes on the face and has to be applied to the face.
但它要贴在脸上，必须经过化妆处理。

733
00:33:17.480 --> 00:33:19.480
So it becomes a makeup thing.
所以它就成了化妆部门的事。

734
00:33:19.680 --> 00:33:23.760
So they just had a tray of a bunch of different mustaches.
他们当时准备了一个托盘，上面放着各种各样的胡子。

735
00:33:23.760 --> 00:33:26.140
And yes, they got Greg's approval.
没错，他们确实得到了格雷格的批准。

736
00:33:26.360 --> 00:33:27.940
They talked to Joss Whedon, the director.
他们和导演乔斯·韦登商量过。

737
00:33:28.120 --> 00:33:29.280
They talked to Mindy Kaling.
他们也和敏迪·卡灵商量过。

738
00:33:29.280 --> 00:33:32.880
And they picked the mustaches for each of these guys to wear.
然后他们为这几个人挑选了各自要戴的胡子。

739
00:33:33.140 --> 00:33:39.180
Hair and makeup would take photos of the guys with the different mustaches and then walk
发型和化妆师会给戴着不同胡子的人拍照片，然后把照片

740
00:33:39.180 --> 00:33:41.380
them over to the writer's room.
送到编剧室。

741
00:33:41.560 --> 00:33:43.640
And the writers and directors would look at it.
编剧和导演们会看这些照片。

742
00:33:43.700 --> 00:33:44.460
I can't imagine.
我简直无法想象。

743
00:33:44.760 --> 00:33:45.900
That is so funny to me.
这对我来说太搞笑了。

744
00:33:46.180 --> 00:33:49.140
Well, next up, the Finer Things Club meeting is underway.
好了，接下来，“精致生活俱乐部”的会议正在进行中。

745
00:33:49.140 --> 00:33:55.200
Yes, and at 10 minutes, 50 seconds, we have a Pam's teapot catch.
是的，在10分50秒的时候，我们发现了一个关于帕姆茶壶的细节。

746
00:33:55.540 --> 00:33:57.380
Yes, that's right.
没错，确实如此。

747
00:33:57.380 --> 00:34:03.620
They are using Pam's teapot that Jim gave her in that very first Christmas episode.
他们正在用吉姆在第一季圣诞特辑里送给帕姆的那个茶壶。

748
00:34:03.720 --> 00:34:06.600
I have a question for the Finer Things Club.
我有一个关于“精致生活俱乐部”的问题。

749
00:34:07.020 --> 00:34:07.420
Yes?
什么问题？

750
00:34:07.420 --> 00:34:12.000
How much stuff do you have to bring to work on the day that you guys meet?
你们开会那天得带多少东西去上班啊？

751
00:34:12.140 --> 00:34:20.960
There is a three-tiered tray of sandwiches, a tablecloth, flatware, the teapot, the cups.
有三层点心架的三明治、桌布、餐具、茶壶和茶杯。

752
00:34:21.540 --> 00:34:24.340
You're like bringing a crate of stuff.
你简直像带了一箱东西过来。

753
00:34:24.680 --> 00:34:25.120
Yeah.
是啊。

754
00:34:25.380 --> 00:34:26.700
Don't worry about it.
别担心。

755
00:34:27.400 --> 00:34:28.860
It doesn't involve you.
这事儿跟你没关系。

756
00:34:29.080 --> 00:34:29.800
We got it covered.
我们搞得定。

757
00:34:30.080 --> 00:34:34.640
They're discussing a room with a view and who walks in but Andy.
他们正在讨论一个有景观的房间，结果安迪走了进来。

758
00:34:35.000 --> 00:34:36.340
He wants to be in the club.
他想加入这个俱乐部。

759
00:34:36.340 --> 00:34:39.580
And Pam tells him it's a closed club.
帕姆告诉他这是个封闭式俱乐部。

