00:42:45.490 --> 00:42:55.390
At 17 minutes, 27 seconds, as Karen and Jim are having their one-on-one, Karen has a photo of Hillary Clinton on her bookshelf.
在17分27秒时，当凯伦和吉姆单独谈话时，凯伦的书架上有一张希拉里·克林顿的照片。

