Appliance people?
家电厂商的人？

1002
00:46:06.290 --> 00:46:08.270
Not everything needs an alarm.
不是什么东西都需要报警声。

1003
00:46:09.630 --> 00:46:10.430
You know?
你懂吗？

1004
00:46:11.390 --> 00:46:13.510
This is, we feel strongly about this.
这是……我们对此深有感触。

1005
00:46:13.750 --> 00:46:15.830
We clearly feel strongly about all the beeping.
我们显然对所有的哔哔声都深有感触。

1006
00:46:16.350 --> 00:46:17.310
Unnecessary beeping.
不必要的哔哔声。

1007
00:46:17.310 --> 00:46:18.610
Who knew?
谁能想到呢？

1008
00:46:19.330 --> 00:46:21.190
Well, the guys get back from Utica.
好吧，那帮人从尤蒂卡回来了。

1009
00:46:21.670 --> 00:46:23.710
Michael gives Stanley his blessing.
迈克尔给了斯坦利他的祝福。

1010
