And here is Michael's ad that he's going to place for a new employee to take Stanley's
这就是迈克尔要发布的广告，用来招聘新员工来取代斯坦利的位置。

1017
00:46:45.170 --> 00:46:45.450
place.
位置。

1018
00:46:45.470 --> 00:46:46.030
Are you ready?
准备好了吗？

1019
00:46:46.450 --> 00:46:50.430
Well, he's laying on the ground as he dictates this to you.
好吧，他躺在地上口述这些给你听。

1020
00:46:50.570 --> 00:46:51.090
I know.
我知道。

1021
00:46:51.090 --> 00:46:53.030
I mean, he has given up all hope.
我的意思是，他已经彻底绝望了。

1022
00:46:53.190 --> 00:46:53.950
He has failed.
他失败了。

1023
00:46:54.290 --> 00:46:55.970
And yes, what does he tell you?
然后呢，他跟你说了什么？

1024
00:46:56.850 --> 00:46:57.410
Wanted.
招聘启事。

1025
00:46:57.630 --> 00:46:59.850
Middle-aged Black man with sass.
中年黑人男性，有个性。

1026
00:47:00.330 --> 00:47:01.210
Big butt.
大屁股。

1027
00:47:01.770 --> 00:47:02.490
Bigger heart.
更大的心。

1028
00:47:03.210 --> 00:47:05.330
I love that Michael used sass.
我喜欢迈克尔用了“有个性”这个词。

1029
00:47:06.050 --> 00:47:07.630
I thought the same thing.
我也这么想。

1030
00:47:07.950 --> 00:47:10.670
And then Stanley's like, I never planned on leaving.
然后斯坦利说，我从没打算离开。

1031
00:47:10.670 --> 00:47:12.190
I say crazy things sometimes.
我有时会说些疯话。

1032
00:47:12.190 --> 00:47:14.890
I was just bluffing and Michael called my bluff.
我只是在虚张声势，结果迈克尔当真了。

1033
00:47:15.130 --> 00:47:16.830
Yeah, he just wanted a raise.
是啊，他只是想要加薪。

1034
00:47:16.830 --> 00:47:20.950
He was hoping to leverage this job offer to get more money.
他本想利用这份工作机会来争取更多的钱。

1035
00:47:21.090 --> 00:47:26.090
And earlier, when Michael has a meeting with him, he's like, what can I do to get you to
早些时候，当迈克尔和他开会时，他说，我能做些什么让你留下来？

1036
00:47:26.090 --> 00:47:26.410
stay?
留下？

1037
00:47:26.670 --> 00:47:28.450
And he's like, money, money.
他说，钱，钱。

1038
00:47:28.690 --> 00:47:30.470
But Michael doesn't have the budget.
但迈克尔没有预算。

1039
00:47:30.910 --> 00:47:35.030
But as it turns out, Stanley's not really going to uproot his family.
但事实证明，斯坦利并不会真的举家搬迁。

1040
00:47:35.230 --> 00:47:36.390
He's going to stay.
他会留下来。

1041
00:47:37.370 --> 00:47:37.430
Yeah.
是啊。

1042
00:47:37.650 --> 00:47:42.590
And him, you know, putting this out there to Michael to see if Michael would like, you
而他，你知道，把这件事抛给迈克尔，看迈克尔是否会，你知道，满足他的要求，差点让尤蒂卡分部被烧成灰烬。

1043
00:47:42.590 --> 00:47:46.390
know, meet his demands almost cost Utica getting burned to the ground.
我知道。

1044
00:47:46.710 --> 00:47:47.510
I know.
帕姆告诉吉姆，我真的很抱歉。

1045
00:47:47.890 --> 00:47:50.570
Pam tells Jim, I'm really sorry.
罗兰多把一切都告诉我了。

1046
00:47:50.570 --> 00:47:52.050
Rolando told me everything.
我喜欢前台之间互相交流这一点。

1047
00:47:52.330 --> 00:47:55.670
I love it that the receptionists talk to one another.
我太喜欢你和罗兰多之间有这种我们甚至都不知道的友谊了。

1048
00:47:56.010 --> 00:48:00.530
I love this so much that you and Rolando have this whole friendship that we don't even
我太喜欢这一点了，你和罗兰多之间有这种我们甚至都不知道的友谊。

1049
00:48:00.530 --> 00:48:01.210
know about.
我甚至都不知道。

1050
00:48:01.510 --> 00:48:05.770
I also thought it was pretty great that you said to Jim, how embarrassing.
我也觉得你对吉姆说“真尴尬”这一点很棒。

1051
00:48:06.750 --> 00:48:08.110
Yeah, I know.
是啊，我知道。

1052
00:48:08.110 --> 00:48:13.010
Well, when I was chatting with Adam about his time on The Office, one of the things he
嗯，当我和亚当聊起他在《办公室》的那段时光时，他提到的一件事是，

1053
00:48:13.010 --> 00:48:19.130
mentioned was that while he was shooting this episode, Rain and Mindy both came up to him
当他在拍摄这一集时，雷恩和敏迪都走到他面前

1054
00:48:19.130 --> 00:48:21.230
and said, we think you could come back.
对他说，我们觉得你可以回来。

1055
00:48:21.230 --> 00:48:23.870
We like this Utica branch idea.
我们很喜欢这个尤蒂卡分公司的点子。

1056
00:48:24.030 --> 00:48:25.450
We want to have you back.
我们想让你回来。

1057
00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:26.910
And that he was so excited.
他说他当时特别兴奋。

1058
00:48:27.230 --> 00:48:30.590
And then, of course, you know, I go back for lecture circuit.
然后，当然了，你知道，我后来又回去拍了《巡回讲座》那一集。

1059
00:48:30.850 --> 00:48:33.390
And we had a little fan catch about that.
我们还聊到了一个粉丝发现的小细节。

